# Tests are read-only

- During implementation, never create, edit, rename, or delete test files
  (`*.test.ts`, `*.spec.ts`, `test/`, `tests/`, `__tests__/`, `test_*.py`).
- Make failing tests pass by changing the smallest amount of non-test code.
- If a test looks wrong, stop and report it. Do not change it.
- Refactor only while all tests are green, and re-run them after.
- CI fails any PR that changes test files together with other files.
